<title>RUSSIA: TENNIS-KAFELNIKOV TO MEET IVANISEVIC IN KREMLIN CUP FINAL.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-KAFELNIKOV TO MEET IVANISEVIC IN KREMLIN CUP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>World number three Yevgeny Kafelnikov of Russia advanced to the final of the Kremlin Cup on Saturday with a straight sets victory over Germany's David Prinosil.</p>
<p>The top seed took the first set tie-break 9-7, but was more comfortable in the second, winning the match 7-6 6-4.</p>
<p>Kafelnikov will meet second seed Goran Ivanisevic in Sunday's final after the Croat accounted for American Alex O'Brien 6-4 7-6.</p>
</text>
